<title>UNITED ARAB EMIRATES: SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT HOLDERS JAPAN 2-0 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT HOLDERS JAPAN 2-0 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>AL-AIN, United Arab Emirates 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait beat</p>
<p>defending champions Japan 2-0 (1-0 halftime) in an Asian Cup</p>
<p>quarter-final tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Jassem Al-Houwaidi 17, 54</p>
<p>Attendence: 2,000</p>
</text>
